SUMMARY:Creativity & Wellness Special Series
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this special 6-week series of the beloved 
 Creativity & Wellness program. We will use a variety of mediums during the 
 sessions culminating in the final group project & art gallery showcase. 
 \n\nYou are registering for all 6 sessions: Oct 2\, 9\, 16\, 23\, 30 and 
 November 6. \n\nPlease note: There is a $40 fee for the series. If there is 
 any financial hardship in regard to this fee\, please call Cindy 
 Concannon\, the Center's Director\, to discuss arrangements. Her number is 
 973-618-3668\n\nPlease pay with cash or check at the Library's Circulation 
 Desk.\n\nIn collaboration with Caldwell University Community Mental Health 
 and Wellness Services The Mary Jo Rolli Codey Center\n\nMore info 
 here.\n\nFinal Collaboration Project November 20 at 10:30am\n\nParticipants 
 come together for the final meeting to complete the group project and enjoy 
 the Art Gallery Opening Reception.\n\nInvite your friends and family for 
 light refreshments at 11am\n
LOCATION:West Caldwell - Community Meeting Room
ORGANIZER;CN="West Caldwell Public Library":MAILTO:programs@westcaldwell.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Class, Craft, Health & Wellness
