SUMMARY:Movie -- The Hobby: Tales from the Tabletop
DESCRIPTION:As part of International Games Month\, come watch the 2024 
 documentary The Hobby: Tales from the Tabletop.\n\nAre games the meaning of 
 life? The Hobby is a funny\, affectionate\, character-driven portrait of 
 the massive subculture of modern board games\, featuring a fascinating and 
 diverse group of subjects who find deep meaning in “meaningless” 
 pursuits.
