DESCRIPTION:Join the Friends of the Library and Caldwell Flowerland to 
 design your very own holiday centerpiece.\n\nGet into the holiday spirit 
 with a fun and festive evening of creativity! Gather your friends and enjoy 
 a night out as you create your very own beautiful winter centerpiece using 
 fresh evergreens and seasonal decorations. You'll take home a unique 
 arrangement\, handcrafted by you\, to add a special touch to your holiday 
 table. No experience necessary-just bring your holiday spirit and enjoy a 
 wonderful evening of friendship\, fun\, and creativity!\n\nLimited spots! 
 Please register separately for each person who will make their own 
 centerpiece.  The registration fee of $45 must be paid in cash\, check made 
 out to the "Friends of the West Caldwell Public Library"\, or a Venmo 
